\loigiai{
\begin{center}
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.72, font=\footnotesize, line cap=round, line join=round]
\coordinate (A) at (2.0,3.4);
\coordinate (B) at (0,0);
\coordinate (C) at (4.0,0);
\coordinate (H) at (2.0,0);
\coordinate (Mc) at ($(A)!0.5!(B)$);
\coordinate (Mb) at ($(A)!0.5!(C)$);
\coordinate (G) at ($1/3*(A)+1/3*(B)+1/3*(C)$);
\draw[thick] (A) -- (B) -- (C) -- cycle;
\draw[blue!75!black] (A) -- (H);
\draw[thin] ($(H)!0.18cm!(A)$) -- ($($(H)!0.18cm!(A)$)+($(H)!0.18cm!(C)$)-(H)$) -- ($(H)!0.18cm!(C)$);
\fill[red] (G) circle (1.8pt) node[below right] {$J$};
\fill (A) circle (1.5pt) node[above] {$A$};
\fill (B) circle (1.5pt) node[below left] {$B$};
\fill (C) circle (1.5pt) node[below right] {$C$};
\fill (H) circle (1.5pt) node[below] {$F$};
\end{tikzpicture}
\end{center}
Vì điểm $J$ nằm trên đoạn thẳng $AF$ nên $AJ + JF = AF$.
Theo giả thiết $JA = \dfrac{2}{3}AF$, suy ra:
$$JF = AF - JA = AF - \dfrac{2}{3}AF = \dfrac{1}{3}AF.$$
Từ đó ta có:
\begin{itemize}
\item $\dfrac{JA}{JF} = \dfrac{\frac{2}{3}AF}{\frac{1}{3}AF} = 2 \Rightarrow JA = 2JF$;
\item $AF = 3 \cdot \dfrac{1}{3}AF = 3JF$.
\end{itemize}
}\end{ex}

